        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 2105, Lexington Oval Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe oval mounts of this Weslock made Lexington Dummy Cylinder entry set paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. The Lexington Handleset comes with your choice of inside handle style. A dummy handleset, the Weslock made Lexington Entry Handleset is just for looks; it does not latch nor does it lock. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. It not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-single-cylinder-lexington-handleset-weslock-2115-2100\"><b>Lexington Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Oval Lexington Dummy Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Oval Lexington Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will be the same as the handleset.</i>\r\n</p>",
